  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_pattens_cb0">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>pattens, overshoes or sandals worn to raise the ordinary shoes out of mud (OED s.v. patten n. 1b) | an overshoe or sandal worn to raise the ordinary shoes out of mud (OED s.v. patten n. 1b) | leather for making patens | nails for making patens | pattens, overshoes or sandals worn to raise the ordinary shoes out of mud (OED s.v. clog n. 6a) | nail for making pattens | nails for making pattens | wood for making pattens | nails used for making clogs</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
